sequenceDiagram
title CurricuPath prerequisite clarification and re-evaluation
participant Student
participant ReactUI
participant FastAPI
participant SessionStore
participant AdvisorEngine
participant CatalogueRepository
Student->>ReactUI: Ask about MATH1049A
ReactUI->>FastAPI: POST /advisor with declared profile
FastAPI->>SessionStore: Load conversation context
SessionStore-->>FastAPI: Existing or empty conversation context
FastAPI->>AdvisorEngine: Advise with interpreted request and context
AdvisorEngine->>CatalogueRepository: Retrieve module rules and source status
CatalogueRepository-->>AdvisorEngine: PRE_MATH1049 and verified source
AdvisorEngine-->>FastAPI: Clarification required for MATH1048A
FastAPI->>SessionStore: Save pending target and prerequisite
FastAPI-->>ReactUI: Ask whether MATH1048A is completed
ReactUI-->>Student: Display focused question
Student->>ReactUI: Declare Completed
ReactUI->>FastAPI: POST /advisor with reply and session ID
FastAPI->>SessionStore: Restore pending prerequisite
SessionStore-->>FastAPI: MATH1049A target and MATH1048A fact
FastAPI->>AdvisorEngine: Apply reply and evaluate original target
AdvisorEngine->>CatalogueRepository: Retrieve applicable rules and source status
CatalogueRepository-->>AdvisorEngine: Source-linked requirements
AdvisorEngine-->>FastAPI: Decision with rule checks and source trace
FastAPI->>SessionStore: Save updated conversation context
FastAPI-->>ReactUI: Structured response
ReactUI-->>Student: Display decision and evidence
